  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcCharts .NET: all 21 series types (line, fast line, step line, area, range area, bar/column, scatter, bubble, candlestick, OHLC, box plot, waterfall, pie, radar, funnel, treemap, sunburst, heatmap, bullet, Sankey, tornado), range selector, views, headless renderer, data sources and interaction, with no functional limits. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. The financial pack (panes, indicators, volume, aggregator, drawing tools), the table link chart shaping (100% stacked, pie and donut kinds, series by rows, top N) and the sgcWebSockets bridge are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
